	<title>Factorisation</title>

    <p>You can factorise the number currently displayed by pressing <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>F</key></keyseq> or by pressing the <gui>fact</gui> button. This button is visible in <link xref="mouse">programming mode</link>.</p>
    <p>To factorise integers bigger than 2^64 the Miller-Rabin primality test and Pollard's rho algorithm are used.</p>
</page>
